  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cameroon: UK Trade Partnerships Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ITC through the UK Trade Partnerships Programme in Cameroon is working with small and medium-sized enterprises along the value chain to increase exports of Penja pepper and cocoa to the UK and EU markets.</narrative>
  </description>
